{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:96bb10a0e5f6e4d47a220fed1ed8ab78eb078fbee7de20a45c881e56d8fcf4e1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_22_t01:1_2_014_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a48a84b5613983269e2afeb5125708641713becd75a4eb5f8a58f9a7e6bfb15b",
      "text": "辛苦了，制作人。\n刚刚才到家，终于能喘口气了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_22_t01:1_2_014_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8c4d63608f7550cb41d0b1e2cb56b4122581a2cfa63d52cff7dbe75d9c69703",
      "text": "真是一个超有趣的企划啊。\n而且我也超级开心。再次谢谢你啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_22_t01:1_2_014_22_t01:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:048afdd8fc77ca8bc877cbc2f781cb09c1c0364ec627612c24dc3a06788084d7",
      "text": "……话说回来。那件事，\n你岂止是掺了一脚，根本是全程参与进去了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_22_t01:1_2_014_22_t01:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e70c287e830d9bc6970ed5b1f119c1105f5865d9e39fc5c9d8cbba92c5612ed6",
      "text": "是的，\n我也协助了大家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_22_t01:1_2_014_22_t01:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:427c962e8bd05299bf65e132cd3782bc3a72a7bb7230164e9497e2817194f98c",
      "text": "作战大获成功呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_22_t01:1_2_014_22_t01:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3149c8d29627d916aa8f50a8c2f1bf6fcadd9bde5f72e2482a940348b1ca7661",
      "text": "可恶，完全被你们摆了一道。\n商讨时和拍摄前我可是一点都没察觉到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_22_t01:1_2_014_22_t01:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42a65f93d5f1c9674ff730994732da969155cdf318e4ee2e930aa03d935d2b77",
      "text": "现在回想起来，龙那家伙当时笑得莫名可疑呢。\n信玄虽然看着挺正常……不对，其实也有点坐立不安啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_22_t01:1_2_014_22_t01:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be60a9ab1d6e13a944b2de2b332aaf4848839c2a2bcc4819915b793ef8ccd864",
      "text": "话虽如此……\n不行，一不留神嘴角就忍不住往上扬。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_22_t01:1_2_014_22_t01:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c418364003dd04c1ecab698e0ec0d92fbd1cb7a8135dadf1a734717ff078abc",
      "text": "能在评论区收到粉丝大家的祝福，\n也让我高兴坏了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_22_t01:1_2_014_22_t01:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:809b0420fb7417525a3b30445c96c8dbb04f44a0f73093c83e91651fc5d097af",
      "text": "蛋糕也很美味……\n虽然吓了一跳，但这真是一个美好的生日啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_22_t01:1_2_014_22_t01:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23b5168158c96a5a805e4a2084dc9b67e5b6618e184d6d1f2450f2313c1e511c",
      "text": "那么，我差不多该睡了。\n晚安，制作人。再次谢谢你啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
